sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client Application
    participant GR as NeMo-Guardrails Server<br/>Port 8000 (HTTP)
    participant InputR as Input Rails Pipeline
    participant OutputR as Output Rails Pipeline
    participant JD as Jailbreak Detection<br/>Port 1337
    participant AS as AlignScore<br/>Port 5000
    participant PII as Presidio PII<br/>Detection
    participant LLM as Upstream LLM Provider<br/>(MAIN_MODEL_BASE_URL)
    participant Azure as Azure OpenAI<br/>Port 443 HTTPS

    Note over Client,Azure: Flow 1: Chat Completion with Guardrails

    Client->>GR: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token><br/>Content-Type: application/json
    GR->>GR: Capture Authorization header<br/>for upstream forwarding

    GR->>InputR: Route user message<br/>through input rails
    InputR->>JD: Check for jailbreak patterns
    JD-->>InputR: Jailbreak check result
    InputR->>PII: Scan for PII
    PII-->>InputR: PII detection result

    alt Input rails PASS
        InputR-->>GR: Message approved
        GR->>LLM: Forward validated request<br/>+ Authorization header
        LLM-->>GR: LLM response
        GR->>OutputR: Route response<br/>through output rails
        OutputR->>AS: Fact-check response<br/>POST /alignscore_base
        AS-->>OutputR: AlignScore result
        alt Output rails PASS
            OutputR-->>GR: Response approved
            GR-->>Client: 200 OK<br/>JSON response
        else Output rails FAIL
            OutputR-->>GR: Response blocked
            GR-->>Client: Guardrail violation response
        end
    else Input rails FAIL
        InputR-->>GR: Message blocked
        GR-->>Client: Guardrail violation response
    end

    Note over Client,Azure: Flow 2: Guardrail-Only Check (no LLM call)

    Client->>GR: POST /v1/guardrail/checks<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    GR->>InputR: Evaluate input rails
    InputR-->>GR: Rail evaluation results
    GR->>OutputR: Evaluate output rails
    OutputR-->>GR: Rail evaluation results
    GR-->>Client: 200 OK<br/>Check results (pass/fail per rail)

    Note over Client,Azure: Flow 3: Azure OpenAI Integration

    Client->>GR: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(Azure-configured engine)
    GR->>InputR: Input rail evaluation
    InputR-->>GR: Approved
    GR->>Azure: HTTPS/443<br/>API Key: AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY<br/>TLS encrypted
    Azure-->>GR: LLM response
    GR->>OutputR: Output rail evaluation
    OutputR-->>GR: Approved
    GR-->>Client: 200 OK JSON response
